<p>Living in an apartment here doesn’t mean sacrificing space or serenity. With Seattle’s thoughtful urban planning, many apartment residents enjoy tree-lined streets, proximity to parks like Discovery Park or Woodland Park, and local businesses that add character to everyday life.</p>
